[6.994367,"o","Usage: veasel mcp <list|add|enable|disable|remove> [options]\r\n\r\nManage configured MCP servers through the local API (user or project scope).\r\nRun `veasel mcp --help` for full syntax. Trust and per-call approval stay in the TUI.\r\n\r\nEnvironment: VEASEL_PORT, VEASEL_DATA_DIR, VEASEL_PLUGIN_DIR\r\n"]
